<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Memoresse Brand Guidebook</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { 
            font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; 
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2d2b2c 0%, #4a4748 100%);
            color: white; 
            height: 100vh; 
            display: flex; 
            align-items: center; 
            justify-content: center; 
        }
        .container { text-align: center; max-width: 600px; padding: 2rem; }
        .logo { 
            width: 150px; 
            height: 150px; 
            background: #f8f7f6; 
            border-radius: 50%; 
            margin: 0 auto 2rem; 
            display: flex; 
            align-items: center; 
            justify-content: center; 
            font-size: 3rem; 
            color: #b2c7b9; 
            font-weight: bold; 
        }
        h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        p { font-size: 1.1rem; opacity: 0.9; line-height: 1.6; }
        .status { 
            margin-top: 2rem; 
            padding: 1rem; 
            background: rgba(178, 199, 185, 0.1); 
            border-radius: 8px; 
            border: 1px solid #b2c7b9; 
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="logo">M</div>
        <h1>Memoresse</h1>
        <p>Interactive Brand Guidebook</p>
        <p>Preserving memories and stories for generations</p>
        <div class="status">
            <p><strong>Status:</strong> Deployment successful!</p>
            <p>This fallback page confirms Amplify is working.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
